  "text": "Service: Datadog US1\nIncident: Delayed Monitors Notifications\nStatus: resolved\nImpact: critical\nStarted: 2026-05-07T20:06:53.056-04:00\nResolved: 2026-05-08T10:07:35.466-04:00\nUpdates:\n- 2026-05-08T10:07:35.466-04:00: resolved - This incident has been resolved.\n- 2026-05-08T02:21:58.194-04:00: monitoring - We have identified upstream provider issues. Metrics, Logs, APM, RUM and CI visibility data are being processed normally for all customers. Alerting is also functional.\nWe are monitoring the situation.\nhttps://health.aws.amazon.com/health/status\n- 2026-05-08T01:44:23.649-04:00: identified - We have identified upstream provider issues. Metrics, Logs, APM and RUM data are being processed normally for all customers. Alerting is also functional. There are still processing delays for CI visibility.\nWe are monitoring the situation.\nhttps://health.aws.amazon.com/health/status\n- 2026-05-08T01:30:42.950-04:00: identified - We have identified upstream provider issues and are continuing to experience delays in processing data across multiple products. We are continuing to work on a fix.\nhttps://health.aws.amazon.com/health/status\n\nFor metrics, distribution metrics and point metrics are being processed normally for all customers.\n- 2026-05-08T00:48:58.359-04:00: identified - We have identified upstream provider issues and are continuing to experience delays in processing data across multiple products. We are continuing to work on a fix.\nhttps://health.aws.amazon.com/health/status\n\nFor metrics, distribution metrics and point metrics are being processed normally for all customers.\n- 2026-05-08T00:13:10.320-04:00: identified - We have identified upstream provider issues and are continuing to experience delays in processing data across multiple products. We are continuing to work on a fix.\nhttps://health.aws.amazon.com/health/status\n\nFor metrics, distribution metrics and point metrics are being processed normally for all customers.\n- 2026-05-07T22:59:28.984-04:00: identified - We have identified due to upstream provider issues, we are continuing to see unavailability of telemetry data coming from AWS into Datadog. We are continuing to work on a fix.\nhttps://health.aws.amazon.com/health/status\n\nFor metrics we are still seeing delays in distribution metrics. Counts, rates and gauge metrics are being processed normally for most customers\n- 2026-05-07T22:16:54.403-04:00: identified - We have identified due to upstream provider issues, we are continuing to see unavailability of telemetry data coming from AWS into Datadog. We are continuing to work on a fix.\n\nhttps://health.aws.amazon.com/health/status\n- 2026-05-07T22:02:49.775-04:00: identified - We have identified upstream provider issues and are continuing to experience delays in processing data across multiple products. We are working on a fix.\n\nhttps://health.aws.amazon.com/health/status\n- 2026-05-07T21:20:34.632-04:00: identified - We have identified upstream provider issues and are continuing to experience delays in processing data across multiple products. We are working on a fix.\n\nhttps://health.aws.amazon.com/health/status\n- 2026-05-07T20:47:17.033-04:00: investigating - Due to upstream provider issues, we are also continuing to see unavailability of telemetry data coming from AWS into Datadog.\n\nhttps://health.aws.amazon.com/health/status\n- 2026-05-07T20:24:05.412-04:00: investigating - We are investigating increased latency across multiple products which began at 23:39 UTC. As a result of this issue, some users may see delays in data across the platform.\n- 2026-05-07T20:06:53.125-04:00: investigating - We are investigating delays in Monitors Notifications, which began at 23:39 UTC.",
